lass=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">3d997a31-fda5-4780-90f0-b00fe43d1734</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:3d997a31-fda5-4780-90f0-b00fe43d1734\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:3d997a31-fda5-4780-90f0-b00fe43d1734\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Guildhall\" title=\"Guildhall\">Guildhall</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-37&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;762</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A scented letter on the ornate stationary of Baldur's Gate's premier bank, the Counting House.]\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Nine-Fingers_Keene\" title=\"Nine-Fingers Keene\">Guildmaster</a>,\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>We are delighted to inform you that we have just taken delivery of a special deposit box, constructed and charmed exactly to your specifications. We eagerly await the arrival of the promised goods into our vault and the fulfillment of your order.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>In highest esteem,\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Rakath Glitterbeard, Fellowship of Financiers\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>[A hasty note slashes across the bottom of the page in a different hand, marked for return delivery.]\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Shite code, Glitterbeard. Don't bother - when we kill the <a href=\"/wiki/Minsc\" title=\"Minsc\">Stone Lord</a>, I want the whole damn city to know who did it.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Progresses <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aid_the_Underduke\" title=\"Aid the Underduke\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aid the Underduke\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Aid_the_Underduke\" title=\"Aid the Underduke\">Aid the Underduke</a>, the party now knows about the ambush at the <a href=\"/wiki/Counting_House\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Counting House\">Counting House</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200810\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1787/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 34380/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9744/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930510/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.064      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   44.064      1 -total\n 56.48%   24.888      8 Template:Icon_text\n 50.15%   22.098     19 Template:Trim\n 22.43%    9.883      2 Template:Uid\n 15.39%    6.780      3 Template:Icon_link\n 14.83%    6.535    